aily visibility: zone-level awareness, pass movement, receiver health, confidence status, incident workflow, and staff response coordination. That foundation is what makes future emergency intelligence possible without building on guesswork.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/#request-pilot\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition duration-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/70 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-white border border-orange-500/20 bg-orange-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-600/20 hover:bg-orange-700 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-orange-600/25 active:translate-y-px \",\"children\":[\"Request Pilot Review\",\"$L6\"]}],\"$L7\"]}]]}],\"$L8\"]}]}],\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\"]}],\"$L10\"],null,\"$L11\"]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],\"$L12\",false]],\"m\":\"$undefined\",\"G\":[\"$13\",[]],\"s\":false,\"S\":true}\n14:I[1356,[\"724\",\"static/chunks/724-cf65792c48e33df3.js\",\"725\",\"static/chunks/725-102a69bb248c73da.js\",\"945\",\"static/chunks/app/future-emergency-readiness/page-e4b4c03c0a1c54b5.js\"],\"Image\"]\n1b:I[4431,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n1d:I[5278,[],\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\"]\n1f:I[4431,[],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n21:I[4431,[],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n22:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n6:[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1ays0h\",{\"d\":\"M5 12h14\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"xquz4c\",{\"d\":\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"#future-boundary\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition duration-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/70 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-white border border-slate-200/80 bg-white/[0.88] text-slate-900 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/60 backdrop-blur hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md active:translate-y-px \",\"children\":[\"View Boundaries\",null]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 shadow-[0_34px_110px_rgba(15,23,42,0.18)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"src\":\"/brand/valkor-floorplan-light.png\",\"alt\":\"Conceptual Valkor floorplan with routed signal paths\",\"width\":1680,\"height\":945,\"priority\":true,\"className\":\"aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover object-center opacity-95\",\"sizes\":\"(min-width: 1024px) 52vw, 100vw\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"Hazard marked\",{\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-slate-950/72 px-3 py-2 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-xl\",\"children\":\"Hazard marked\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Exit available\",{\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-slate-950/72 px-3 py-2 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-xl\",\"children\":\"Exit available\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Confidence likely\",{\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-slate-950/72 px-3 py-2 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-xl\",\"children\":\"Confidence likely\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Staff assigned\",{\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-slate-950/72 px-3 py-2 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-white backdrop-blur-xl\",\"children\":\"Staff assigned\"}]]}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"border-b border-slate-200 bg-[#f5f5f7] px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.95fr_1.05fr] lg:items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold uppercase text-cyan-700\",\"children\":\"Why It Matters\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-6xl\",\"children\":\"Real buildings do not move in perfect plans.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Most school safety systems are built around fixed procedures: lockdown here, evacuate there, follow the posted route. Those procedures matter. Worst-case events rarely unfold inside clean assumptions.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Students are not always in classrooms. Staff may be in hallways. Someone may be in the bathroom, cafeteria, office, stairwell, gym, or between zones. A hallway can become crowded. An exit can become unsafe. A route that works for the majority may fail the person who starts from the wrong place at the wrong time.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"Static plans protect the average scenario. Valkor is being designed for the variables.\"}]]}]]}]}]\na:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold uppercase text-orange-700\",\"children\":\"Current and Future\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-5xl text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"The boundary is part of the product.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600\",\"children\":\"Valkor keeps a clear line between what is active today, what is being built toward, and what must be separately approved before emergency use.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm shadow-slate-200/60 sm:p-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-6 w-6\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"dzmm74\",{\"d\":\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"Where Valkor starts\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600\",\"children\":\"Valkor begins with school-controlled operational awareness: approved badges, school-defined zones, active passes, receiver or anchor health, stale-data handling, confidence levels, and admin-reviewed incidents.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-[2rem] border border-orange-200 bg-orange-50 p-6 shadow-sm shadow-orange-100/60 sm:p-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-orange-200 bg-white text-orange-700\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-git-branch h-6 w-6\",\"aria-hi